(6338595, 938846, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job taking a boring subject and making it interesting. the B&amp;W really helps with that.</td>', 'Great job taking a boring subject and making it interesting. the B&W really helps with that.', '2011-03-02 08:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338596, 938752, 10785, '<td valign="top">Given your title, the B&amp;W doesn''t really reflect the mood or energy of the green movement. It gives off a sad or negative emotion of that type. What is the big black shadow on the right? Otherwise, good focus and nice arrangement of the items.</td>', 'Given your title, the B&W doesn''t really reflect the mood or energy of the green movement. It gives off a sad or negative emotion of that type. What is the big black shadow on the right? Otherwise, good focus and nice arrangement of the items.', '2011-03-02 08:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
