(6338601, 938803, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good concept. The lighting and exposure are very similar to another photo in this challenge. I am assuming you teamed up with someone and shared resources. I like the arrangement and the use of light in the background to mimic the sunrise. It is too dark overall and underexposed.</td>', 'Good concept. The lighting and exposure are very similar to another photo in this challenge. I am assuming you teamed up with someone and shared resources. I like the arrangement and the use of light in the background to mimic the sunrise. It is too dark overall and underexposed.', '2011-03-02 08:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
