(6338616, 937844, 10785, '<td valign="top">Sweet. The only way I see this done in basic is long exposure with a strobe popping consistently throughout the shot at a high frequency. I''m no rocket scientist, but I am guessing a shutter speed at 1 second or less and a  frequency of minimum 12 flashes per second.</td>', 'Sweet. The only way I see this done in basic is long exposure with a strobe popping consistently throughout the shot at a high frequency. I''m no rocket scientist, but I am guessing a shutter speed at 1 second or less and a  frequency of minimum 12 flashes per second.', '2011-03-02 08:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
